        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS \nPLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\n*** STUNNING 4 BEDROOM / 3 BATHROOM HOUSE *** A-RATED HOME *** AMAZING CONDITION *** AVAILABLE NOW ***\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS proudly present this exceptional four-bedroom, three-bathroom house to the rental market, ideally located in the highly sought-after Walkers Gate development, Kildare Town, Co. Kildare.\nThis superb A-rated home is presented in amazing condition throughout and offers bright, spacious, and well-proportioned living accommodation finished to an excellent standard. The accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a generous living room, a modern fully fitted kitchen with dining area, four spacious bedrooms, including a master bedroom with en-suite, a stylish main bathroom, and an additional bathroom. The property also benefits from excellent energy efficiency, modern finishes throughout, and a private rear garden.\nWalkers Gate is a modern and desirable residential development ideally located in Kildare Town, Co. Kildare. The property is conveniently positioned close to a wide range of local amenities including shops, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, parks, and leisure facilities. Kildare Town Centre is easily accessible, while excellent transport links provide convenient access to surrounding areas and Dublin. The property also benefits from convenient access to the M7, making commuting simple and convenient.\nViewing is highly recommended.\nAdditional Features:\n<ul>\n <li>Stunning 4 Bed / 3 Bath house\n• A-rated home\n• Amazing condition throughout\n• Bright and spacious living accommodation\n• Modern fully fitted kitchen with dining area\n• Four generous bedrooms\n• Master bedroom with en-suite\n• Stylish main bathroom\n• Additional bathroom\n• Private rear garden\n• Excellent energy efficiency\n• Modern and highly sought-after development\n• Convenient location in Walkers Gate, Kildare Town, Co. Kildare\n• Easy access to the M7\n• Available immediately</li>\n</ul>\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS \nEMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY / NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT-HAND SIDE AND CLICK SEND MESSAGE WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE."
